   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The House adopted the amendment in the nature of a substitute as agreed to by the Committee of the Whole House on the state of the Union.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H35000",
   "actionDate": "1991-06-05",
   "actionTime": "12:31:42",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The previous question was ordered pursuant to the rule.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H32600",
   "actionDate": "1991-06-05",
   "actionTime": "12:31:00",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The House rose from the Committee of the Whole House on the state of the Union to report H.R. 1.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "1991-06-05",
   "actionTime": "10:47:00",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H. Res. 162, the Committee of the Whole proceeded with one hour of debate on the amendment in the nature of a substitute offered by Mr. Brooks.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H32050",
   "actionDate": "1991-06-05",
   "actionTime": "10:45:52",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The House resolved into Committee of the Whole House on the state of the Union for further consideration.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H30000",
   "actionDate": "1991-06-05",
   "actionTime": "10:45:27",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Considered as unfinished business.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H32700",
   "actionDate": "1991-06-04",
   "actionTime": "21:28:43",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Committee of the Whole House on the state of the Union rises leaving H.R. 1 as unfinished business.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "1991-06-04",
   "actionTime": "19:49:29",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H. Res. 162, the Committee of the Whole proceeded with one hour of debate on the Michel amendment.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "1991-06-04",
   "actionTime": "18:07:45",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H. Res. 162, the Committee of the Whole proceeded with one hour of debate on the Towns amendment.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "1991-06-04",
   "actionTime": "14:25:59",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "GENERAL DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H. Res. 162, the Committee of the Whole proceeded with three hours of general debate.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H32400",
   "actionDate": "1991-06-04",
   "actionTime": "14:25:27",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The Speaker designated the Honorable Kweisi Mfume to act as Chairman of the Committee.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H32020",
   "actionDate": "1991-06-04",
   "actionTime": "14:25:24",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "House resolved itself into the Committee of the Whole House on the state of the Union pursuant to H. Res. 162 and Rule XXIII.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "1991-06-04",
   "actionTime": "14:25:09",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 1 with 3 hours of general debate. Previous question shall be considered as ordered without intervening motions except motion to recommit. It shall be in order to consider the amendment in the nature of a substitute recommended by the Com mittee on Education and Labor now printe d in the bill as an original bill for the pu rpose of amendment under the five-minute rule. Measure will be considered rea d. Specified amendments are in or der.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H30000",
   "actionDate": "1991-06-04",
   "actionTime": "14:25:04",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 162.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H1L220",
   "actionDate": "1991-06-04",
   "actionTime": "14:07:21",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rule H. Res. 162 passed House.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H1L210",
   "actionDate": "1991-06-03",
   "actionTime": "12:24:43",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rules Committee Resolution H. Res. 162 Reported to House. Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 1 with 3 hours of general debate. Previous question shall be considered as ordered without intervening motions except motion to recommit. It shall be in order to consider the amendment in the nature of a substitute recommended by the Com mittee on Education and Labor now printe d in the bill as an original bill for the pu rpose of amendment under the five-minute rule. Measure will be considered rea d. Specified amendments are in or der.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
